ssible to bounce a message off Luna's networks to get a message sent throughout Nivalis. A message that can't be traced.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I am not sure. But Luna can be a relay. It is possible to bounce a message off Luna's networks to get a message sent throughout Nivalis. A message that can't be traced.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2375.0,"y":500.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"28248","byteOffset":18569576,"byteLength":476}},{"id":"DFr_B0D701B3","articyId":"72057645577586902","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Thaddeus Carminus","text":"Hello Kid. It's been a while. Is this you before the accident or... well I guess it doesn't matter. Look, there's two things you need to know.... the .... and... or the start of it all....","speakerId":"Ntt_C9C0A9E5","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Hello Kid. It's been a while. Is this you before the accident or... well I guess it doesn't matter. Look, there's two things you need to know.... the .... and... or the start of it all....","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2975.0,"y":500.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"26839","byteOffset":18033056,"byteLength":532}},{"id":"DFr_64DFA785","articyId":"72057645577586917","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"The message is corrupted. I'll salvage what I can. Reconstituting the data.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"The message is corrupted. I'll salvage what I can. Reconstituting the data.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x